OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fwith lengthy clear skies this evening
OL,7,Fand overnight. Under the clear skies
OL,8,Ftemperatures will fall quickly to
OL,9,Fbring a cold evening, though less cold
OL,10,Fthan on Friday night with only a touch
OL,11,Fof frost in places. Becoming breezier.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FDry with some sunny spells in
OL,14,Fthe north, but cloudier further south
OL,15,Fbringing hazy sunshine. Feeling cold
OL,16,Fin an easterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
